    LLM: 'Game: Snip Snap Snorum. Logic: Be the first player to get rid of all cards by playing legal sequence cards.',
    Player: 'Snip Snap Snorum is a traditional round game for four to eight players who shed cards by extending ascending suit sequences of up to five cards.',
    objective: 'Be the first player to get rid of all cards by playing legal sequence cards.',
    gameplay: 'A player leads a card, and the sequence continues upward in the same suit for as many as five cards. Players who cannot continue pass. When the sequence stops, the player who made the last legal play starts a new sequence.',
